========================================================================
EXTENSION 2 — pagination regression repair (2026-11-12, 22:40 UTC, PR #55)
========================================================================

PR #53's fetchAll looped `page=N` against a cursor-paginated endpoint
(pagination.next; the `page` query param does not exist), so the loop
refetched page 1 forever and deploy jobs hung in env-sync until newer
runs cancelled them (runs 43315256665 / 43316005478). The interim fix
(9a71149ed, single unpaginated GET) stopped the hang but silently
truncates once a project outgrows the default page size. PR #55 restores
completeness without the hang: single GET first (matching Vercel's own
CLI, get-env-records.ts), then follow pagination.next only while the API
returns one — capped at 10 pages, with id-dedup terminating a replaying
cursor immediately.

