(fail-closed behind TELEGRAM_STAFF_USER_IDS), resolver env-override ->
DB -> honest-skip wired into /api/viewing-requests and /api/inquiries,
admin API GET/POST /api/admin/telegram-role-chats, env-sync additions,
18 new tests. Migration 044 applied to production. Live-verified: webhook
fail-closed 401s, correct-secret probe 200, admin guard 401, smoke 15/15.

bc18736ec: lockfile regeneration for apps/whatsapp-bot (follow-up to the
owner's 61fb3f5a9, which added the package without a lockfile update and
broke every frozen-lockfile install).

OPERATOR BLOCKER: TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN is revoked (GitHub secret Unauthorized,
